  "query_preview": "..\nAn unsettled weather pattern produced by an extensive monsoon trough\ndominated primarily by a developing disturbance known as Invest 93W \nwell to the east, will continue for at least a few more days. Mostly\ndry conditions are expected overnight, followed by some patchy \nshowers developing Wednesday as the southwesterly monsoon continues\nto build. Conditions will deteriorate as Invest 93W continues to \nconsolidate and pass to the northeast of the Marianas sometime \nFriday through Saturday, inducing a significant monsoon surge that \nwill bring a peak in shower and thunder potential by the weekend. \nConditions are then expected to remain wet coming into next week as a\nsouthwesterly monsoon regime continues.",
